1.2020 : File descriptions

aln2coor 	: function to convert multiple-sequence alignment (characters) to numerical coordinates
gdist		: function to compute Cartesian distance between all coordinate pairs, or to a reference set
pca		: Compute MSA & add to database for subsequent pca analysis
mkmsa		: run pca (above) for multiple tables
msa2proj	: starting from an MSA, compute projections onto PCA eigenvectors
loadmsa		: load MSA and plot projections onto PCA as a scatter plot
pcahost, pcatype, pcayear : compute PCA projections
